{"uuid": null, "parentUuid": null, "vendorSessionId": "harness", "kind": "assistant", "ts": 1795000248000, "text": "Pinned sessions now skip the idle stop.\n\nThe decision reads the pinned flag before the minutes, so a pinned machine never counts down.\n\nShould dormant sessions count as pinned too?"}
